{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully filmed FMV experience \u2014 Every scene feels like a cinematic moment with real actors, genuine dialogue, and immersive audio.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904990/extras/1b330d57038a0ecb272f57e312cdac1d.avif?t=1760077307\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unforgettable heroines \u2014 From cheerful confidantes to enigmatic spirits, each character invites exploration and empathy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904990/extras/005abea43a29c6709123f9d2f0721cff.poster.avif?t=1760077307\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904990/extras/005abea43a29c6709123f9d2f0721cff.webm?t=1760077307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching story routes &amp; multiple endings \u2014 Your choices determine whether your tale ends in love, truth, or lingering mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904990/extras/013a9447af33d7c5bbebb876593b3a23.avif?t=1760077307\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hauntingly charming Thai school setting \u2014 In the glow of classroom lamps and echo of empty corridors, romance and suspense intertwine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904990/extras/680fac9f5966bc549e55400ade06ae84.avif?t=1760077307\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite curiosity... but beware what\u2019s hidden behind the lockers. Are you ready to uncover the dark heart of schoolyard affection?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904990?t=1760077307","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904990/dca7579c44a992ac4b947d796180199f8efb04ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760077307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904990/b35e8e8311a7950b96a48c416ad10cc588e08b27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760077307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904990/b35e8e8311a7950b96a48c416ad10cc588e08b27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760077307","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully filmed FMV experience \u2014 Every scene feels like a cinematic moment with real actors, genuine dialogue, and immersive audio.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904990/extras/1b330d57038a0ecb272f57e312cdac1d.avif?t=1760077307\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unforgettable heroines \u2014 From cheerful confidantes to enigmatic spirits, each character invites exploration and empathy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/